OL,5,G0440 World's Greatest Palaces
OL,6,     FKensington Palace: Kensington
OL,7,     FPalace, which began life as an
OL,8,     Fearly 17th-century Jacobean
OL,9,     Fmansion before becoming a palace
OL,10,     Ffit for the monarchy, and was the
OL,11,     Fbrainchild of Christopher Wren.
OL,12,G0530 Great Coastal Railway Journeys
OL,13,     FKimmeridge to Brownsea Island:
OL,14,     FMichael Portillo visits Dorset's
OL,15,     FJurassic Coast. He heads through
OL,16,     FSwanage, Poole and Sandbanks,
OL,17,     Fbefore ending his journey on
OL,18,     FBrownsea Island.
